# Terraform state contains resource detail and must never be committed.
#
# A saved PLAN is worse than state: it embeds the *values* of input variables,
# so `-out=tfplan` writes the hcloud_token into a zip in plaintext. This file
# was tracked in a public repo for exactly that reason, which is why it is
# listed first now.
tfplan
*.tfplan
*.tfplan.*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
crash.log
